⚠️ <strong>Font Caching</strong> - Requires renderer-side changes
⚠️ <strong>Full Unicode Rendering</strong> - Requires glyph mapping system</p><p><h2>Recommended Font Combinations</h2></p><p><h3>For English-Only Games:</h3>
